{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2021-05-03 08:00:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC ANNOUNCES CE MARK OF EVOLUT™ PRO+ TAVI SYSTEM FOR TREATMENT OF SYMPTOMATIC SEVERE AORTIC STENOSIS PATIENTS IN EUROPE', 'text': 'AS TAVI PATIENT POPULATION GROWS, PRO+ TAVI SYSTEM LAUNCHES WITH FOUR VALVE SIZES AND LOWEST DELIVERY PROFILE DUBLIN, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE: MDT), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED CE (CONFORMITÉ EUROPÉENNE) MARK OF THE EVOLUT™ PRO+ TAVI SYSTEM – THE NEWEST-GENERATION MEDTRONIC TAVI SYSTEM THAT BUILDS OFF THE PROVEN SELF-EXPANDING, SUPRA-ANNULAR EVOLUT TAVI PLATFORM. THE EVOLUT PRO+ TAVI SYSTEM INCLUDES FOUR VALVE SIZES WITH AN EXTERNAL PERICARDIAL TISSUE WRAP THAT PROVIDES ADVANCED SEALING FOR THE LARGEST ANNULAR RANGE (FOR SELF-EXPANDING TAVI TECHNOLOGY) ON THE MARKET.'}